  "prefLabel": "Gcd 202.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 202.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution. The commission shall resolve by agreement, decision after hearing or order of settlement all disputes within the scope of RSA 275-C, RSA 362-E and the administrative rules implementing those statutes.\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
